{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_deployment_deployment", "label": "构建与部署 (Build & Deployment Guide)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/DEPLOYMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "只记录当前可执行的启动方式；真机飞行前必须由现场操作者完成遥控器、PX4 参数和硬件急停检查；同一 UDP 端口只能运行一个 Agent"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_deployment_colcon_build", "label": "colcon 构建流程 (colcon build --symlink-install)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/DEPLOYMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_deployment_deployment_build_artifact_cleanup", "label": "增量构建产物清理 (Incremental Build Artifact Cleanup)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/DEPLOYMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "colcon+rosidl 增量构建只增不删；.msg/.srv 消息接口变更后残留旧生成产物，C typesupport 与 Python 静态扩展各自独立判断重跑，极易出现新库+旧扩展混搭；编译期不报错、运行时 import 才炸 (undefined symbol / UnsupportedTypeSupport) 且每次启动必现；版本切换或接口变更后必须全量清理重建"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_deployment_full_sitl", "label": "完整 SITL 仿真 (start_full_simulation.sh)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/DEPLOYMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_deployment_deployment_sitl_env", "label": "SITL 环境切换 (sitl_env.sh v4 px4_msgs overlay)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/DEPLOYMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "sitl_env.sh 将隔离构建的 v4 px4_msgs overlay 提升到环境前端，使 vehicle_status_v4 与 PX4 SITL 匹配；不要在已加载真机 v1 消息的终端直接运行 SITL 节点"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_deployment_real_flight_system", "label": "真机全系统 (real_flight.launch.py)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/DEPLOYMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "相机为 USB→Jetson V4L2 (/dev/v4l/by-id/usb-D-VITEC_U3344W-video-index0)；PX4 经以太网 UDP→Jetson MicroXRCEAgent 端口 8888；PX4 状态话题为 /fmu/out/vehicle_status_v1；rc_require_arm_signal=true 必须由遥控器 Arm Switch 允许解锁"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_deployment_microxrceagent", "label": "MicroXRCEAgent 唯一实例 (UDP 8888)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/DEPLOYMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "同一 UDP 端口只能运行一个 Agent；脚本 Step 0 清理旧 Agent 保证端口唯一；Agent 意外退出时脚本检测并停止任务节点（等价旧的 launch exit guard），不能忽略该报错继续飞行；飞控晚于 Jetson 上电超 60s 时用 --agent-only 模式"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_deployment_smoke_test", "label": "分阶段 smoke test (simple_mission_real.sh)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/DEPLOYMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "simple_mission_real.sh 是旧的简化航点/投放测试入口，不等价于完整 FSM；只适合验证通信、起飞、简单航点和返航链路；完整任务必须使用 real_flight.launch.py"}, {"id": "docs_deployment_deployment_fault_diagnostics", "label": "停止与故障定位 (Stop & Fault Diagnostics)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/Deployment/DEPLOYMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "真机异常时优先由操作者切换遥控器安全/手动模式再停止上位机节点，不要在飞行中依赖终端清理命令代替接管；undefined symbol / UnsupportedTypeSupport 启动即崩=增量构建残留，全量清理重建；降落失败不得掩盖为 PX4 LAND"}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_deployment_deployment", "target": "docs_deployment_deployment_colcon_build", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/Deployment/DEPLOYMENT.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_deployment_deployment", "target": "docs_deployment_deployment_build_artifact_cleanup", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence